      "created_at": "2019-02-14T16:28:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, is this ever going to be a thing! Trying to think how this spirit would play.</p>\n<p>Dahan generation. Potential explorer generation. Powers that have dahan kill explores out of revenge. Stops ravages. No powers that directly damage units. Have invaders/dahan skip turns. Convert dahan into invaders and vice versa. Powers that gather/push dahan/explorers. Beast generation. Sacred sites that stop ravages? (Probably too OP). Plays with Strife counters.</p>",
